WEBVTT

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:04.990
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:07.910
"Be strong and sad!"

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:11.780
Just a little more, just a little bit more.

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:16.300
Raise your hands!

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:27.180
I'm sure you won't realize it,

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:31.110
But you're the same as you always were.

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:35.840
You smiled at me.

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:41.940
Like a leaf swaying in the wind,

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:48.790
It seems like my heart is going to explode.

00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:53.630
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:56.580
"Be strong and be sad!"

00:00:57.070 --> 00:01:00.560
Just a little more, just a little bit more.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:04.480
Raise your hands!

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:09.250
Someday, you will be gentle,

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:12.350
And understand what I am saying to you!

00:01:12.670 --> 00:01:16.210
It'll be all right, no matter where you go,

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:20.720
This excitement will never stop!

00:01:42.330 --> 00:01:43.540
H-Hey.

00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:46.870
Who is she?

00:01:51.790 --> 00:01:53.130
She's so radiant!

00:01:53.460 --> 00:01:54.760
Y-Yeah.

00:02:12.020 --> 00:02:14.730
I'll finally be able to meet you, Riku.

00:02:15.940 --> 00:02:20.820
An Exciting Transfer Student

00:02:20.990 --> 00:02:27.000
Do you like it or hate it?

00:02:24.580 --> 00:02:26.290
Whoa!

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:34.500
Boat racing

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:34.500
Protein

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:27.580
Young Gang Weekly

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:27.660
Main Feature

00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:29.540
Look! How about her?

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:31.250
Isn't she pretty?

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:33.590
WOW!

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:36.510
Hey! Aoba!

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:37.510
Come here for a sec!

00:02:39.130 --> 00:02:40.180
What're you looking at?

00:02:41.340 --> 00:02:42.800
Look at this swimsuit model!

00:02:43.010 --> 00:02:45.510
She's my latest idol!

00:02:46.020 --> 00:02:47.890
Oh! Let me see!

00:02:54.900 --> 00:02:56.940
Higashino Yukari-chan!

00:02:57.230 --> 00:02:57.570
I've fallen in

00:02:57.230 --> 00:02:57.570
love with Yukari!

00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:02.740
Y-Yukari!

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:09.870
Okay! Take your seats!

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:14.790
All right, class, are you all happy?

00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:18.760
I'll introduce a transfer student to you today.

00:03:19.470 --> 00:03:22.090
Anyway, she's a very adorable young lady.

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:23.970
Please, come in.

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:58.210
I'm Higashino Yukari.

00:03:58.710 --> 00:04:02.840
I'll be studying with you from today, so let's be friends!

00:04:11.430 --> 00:04:14.350
No! Amamiya is better than she is!

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:15.770
For real?!

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:18.860
The famous idol Higashino Yukari is our classmate!

00:04:19.610 --> 00:04:21.360
This is a miracle from God!

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:24.700
Wh-What is she doing here?

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:34.830
I missed you!

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:38.340
Riku.

00:04:40.170 --> 00:04:41.010
I knew it.

00:04:41.010 --> 00:04:42.880
What are you doing here, Yukari?

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:44.970
I missed you so much, Riku!

00:04:49.810 --> 00:04:51.470
Y-Yukari-chan!

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:54.230
Do you know Riku-kun?

00:04:54.850 --> 00:04:59.980
Yes. We're childhood friends, and when we were kids, we promised to marry each other!

00:05:01.150 --> 00:05:03.820
I-Is this... a trial from God?

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:08.490
I heard that Riku transferred to this school, so I came along too.

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:33.520
I usually eat at that restaurant, so I had them deliver these dishes to school to celebrate our reunion.

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:36.310
Don't you think you're overdoing it?

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:38.900
C'mon, Riku! Don't be shy! Eat up!

00:05:39.310 --> 00:05:40.690
Say "ahhh"!

00:05:40.690 --> 00:05:42.230
I'm fine!

00:05:42.230 --> 00:05:43.780
You don't have to feed me!

00:05:43.780 --> 00:05:45.610
C'mon! Have some more! Geez!

00:05:46.650 --> 00:05:47.660
Riku-kun.

00:05:47.990 --> 00:05:49.240
Do you have a minute?

00:05:49.990 --> 00:05:51.030
Oh? What is it?

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:57.670
Don't show off like this. We can't stand it.

00:06:00.580 --> 00:06:03.090
But I'm not trying to...

00:06:03.420 --> 00:06:06.130
I'm asking you a question on behalf of the boys here.

00:06:06.670 --> 00:06:08.090
How did you start going out with each other?

00:06:08.550 --> 00:06:10.680
Oh, I'll tell you.

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:12.760
Yukari-chan will...

00:06:17.430 --> 00:06:22.610
It happened while we were in kindergarten together.

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:34.870
I was standing in front of a huge puddle on the way home.

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:37.870
Then, Riku suddenly showed up.

00:06:42.420 --> 00:06:46.010
He carried me over the puddle on his back.

00:06:47.090 --> 00:06:50.220
Back then, I felt his love for me.

00:06:51.390 --> 00:06:52.800
My feelings...

00:06:54.470 --> 00:06:55.890
THAT'S NOT TRUE!!

00:06:56.430 --> 00:07:00.140
Yukari did such horrible things to me back then!

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:09.530
It was sunny that day, and she was showing off her new shoes.

00:07:09.990 --> 00:07:11.820
She didn't want to get her shoes dirty.

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:24.920
She used me as a bridge to get across the puddle!

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:32.800
Why? Why did you make up such a horrible lie?

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:33.930
Riku!

00:07:33.930 --> 00:07:35.010
Look who's talking!

00:07:35.010 --> 00:07:36.390
Behave yourself!

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:38.140
You're so mean!

00:07:38.140 --> 00:07:39.060
You're horrible!

00:07:40.310 --> 00:07:44.480
You're doing it again! You always pretend to cry when things aren't going your way.

00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:47.820
What's this creepy feeling?

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:49.360
Riku-kun.

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:50.860
Aren't you ashamed of yourself?

00:07:50.860 --> 00:07:52.070
Aoba!

00:07:52.240 --> 00:07:53.990
I never thought you were like that!

00:07:54.780 --> 00:07:56.200
You've got the wrong idea, Icchi!

00:07:56.530 --> 00:07:58.580
She really did such horrible things to me!

00:07:58.910 --> 00:08:00.160
Aoba!

00:08:00.370 --> 00:08:02.120
Apologize to Yukari-chan!

00:08:02.410 --> 00:08:03.370
But...

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:05.670
Hey! Everyone...

00:08:05.670 --> 00:08:07.090
I'm telling the truth about Yukari!

00:08:08.710 --> 00:08:11.090
Wh-Why do I have to?

00:08:12.470 --> 00:08:14.800
Oh, cut it out!

00:08:14.800 --> 00:08:16.350
Stop bullying Riku!

00:08:16.850 --> 00:08:18.600
Are you all right, Riku?

00:08:19.180 --> 00:08:20.770
Of course I'm not all right!

00:08:20.770 --> 00:08:23.600
But you were in the wrong.

00:08:27.020 --> 00:08:29.270
So that's Higashino Yukari-chan.

00:08:29.730 --> 00:08:30.940
Let's get her autograph.

00:08:31.740 --> 00:08:33.990
The boys are so excited today.

00:08:34.320 --> 00:08:36.410
They got to see an idol. What did you expect?

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:40.410
I believe in him.

00:08:41.870 --> 00:08:42.870
I feel sorry for him.

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:44.920
Riku-kun!

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:44.920
Aoba-san!

00:08:54.670 --> 00:08:57.150
This unexpected late development!

00:08:59.100 --> 00:09:00.260
Hey, Riku.

00:09:00.680 --> 00:09:03.100
Wanna go shopping with me on the way home?

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:09.150
At this rate, I might relive my childhood nightmares!

00:09:09.570 --> 00:09:11.110
Are you listening, Riku?

00:09:11.940 --> 00:09:13.860
Oh, I need to use the bathroom.

00:09:16.570 --> 00:09:19.200
Take one step forward!

00:09:16.570 --> 00:09:20.450
Keep the toilet clean!
Cleaning Committee.

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:25.790
Anyway, I'll be in danger if I stay with Yukari like this.

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:29.290
But... how should I get away from her?

00:09:29.490 --> 00:09:30.530
I came to save you Riku-kun.

00:09:32.340 --> 00:09:33.300
Hiyoko-kun!

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:35.720
You've come to save me, right?

00:09:37.180 --> 00:09:38.430
Doujima-kun.

00:09:38.430 --> 00:09:42.430
Whenever you're in trouble, I'll be there to help you as your friend.

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:43.770
And I...

00:09:43.790 --> 00:09:44.320
Let's go!

00:09:45.520 --> 00:09:46.520
Let's go.

00:09:50.400 --> 00:09:51.110
Okay.

00:09:51.360 --> 00:09:52.440
Now's your chance.

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:05.950
I got it! That was close!

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:09.120
Don't underestimate me.

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:12.460
I can play the role of a kunoichi.

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:12.460
Note: A kunoichi is a female ninja.

00:10:12.460 --> 00:10:14.050
I'm a drama idol, after all.

00:10:15.510 --> 00:10:17.470
I'll take care of her!

00:10:22.180 --> 00:10:25.100
I don't want to use force on a girl.

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:29.690
This is for the strong bonds of friendship I share with Aoba.

00:10:30.210 --> 00:10:30.780
Do it!

00:10:31.480 --> 00:10:32.650
Here I come!

00:10:33.190 --> 00:10:34.110
Final Move:

00:10:34.530 --> 00:10:36.360
KINCHATO KATO!

00:10:34.530 --> 00:10:36.360
Note: Kinchatokato is a made-up word.

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:40.820
You've gotta be kidding me!

00:10:41.780 --> 00:10:42.450
What?

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:48.410
How could she dodge the Kinchatokato?

00:10:54.290 --> 00:10:55.460
Hiyoko-kun!

00:10:57.420 --> 00:10:59.920
Leave my dead body and go, Riku.

00:11:01.050 --> 00:11:03.800
That's easier said than done!

00:11:04.810 --> 00:11:06.430
Oh, Riku.

00:11:06.430 --> 00:11:08.680
You have lots of weird friends.

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:15.820
HOLD IT!

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:19.400
I won't let you have Riku-kun!

00:11:20.280 --> 00:11:21.820
Please give up on him.

00:11:23.990 --> 00:11:26.200
I won't give up so easily.

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:31.420
I'm Tsukasa! I'm Mina!

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:34.290
Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love!

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:36.880
I'm Higashino Yukari.

00:11:36.880 --> 00:11:39.630
Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love!

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:48.970
It's time for a Student Council Special Event!

00:11:50.730 --> 00:11:52.310
But still, Aoba-kun...

00:11:53.150 --> 00:11:53.900
Yes?

00:11:55.150 --> 00:11:57.940
Why are you so popular?

00:11:58.610 --> 00:12:00.900
I-I'm not that popular.

00:12:01.570 --> 00:12:09.750
The girls almost had a fight over you yesterday, but I managed to use my influence on the Student Council to stop them.

00:12:10.660 --> 00:12:16.290
Right now, we've got Yukari-kun, a popular idol, so we're all in a good mood for the run-up to the Cultural Festival.

00:12:17.290 --> 00:12:22.720
However! As a member of the Student Council, I can't ignore anyone who disturbs the peace at school!

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:24.260
YEAH!!

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:32.980
So, a judging panel will decide the winner of our Love Game!

00:12:33.230 --> 00:12:37.770
YEAH!!

00:12:37.940 --> 00:12:40.440
Tsumugino High School

00:12:37.940 --> 00:12:40.440
Drama

00:12:37.940 --> 00:12:40.440
Club

00:12:37.940 --> 00:12:40.440
Special

00:12:37.940 --> 00:12:40.440
Event

00:12:47.660 --> 00:12:48.660
Sayuri!

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:50.370
Thank goodness!

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:51.950
What's wrong?

00:12:52.370 --> 00:12:54.830
Sakurai-kun really is holding the event!

00:12:55.210 --> 00:12:56.880
The girls are competing for Aoba!

00:12:57.790 --> 00:12:59.500
They're competing for Aoba?

00:13:00.090 --> 00:13:00.750
I see.

00:13:01.300 --> 00:13:03.170
Why don't you come along, Sayuri?

00:13:03.760 --> 00:13:05.430
I'll give it a miss.

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:06.470
Oh, you!

00:13:07.050 --> 00:13:11.310
Girls will be fighting it out to win his heart!

00:13:11.310 --> 00:13:12.930
Doesn't that sound exciting?

00:13:13.480 --> 00:13:14.480
I'm...

00:13:14.480 --> 00:13:19.150
And from what Sakurai-kun said earlier, this will be a major event they're holding as a lead-up to the Culture festival.

00:13:20.360 --> 00:13:24.570
As a member of the Administrative Committee, you can't afford to miss it, now can you?

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:27.570
Honestly! Well, I guess I'll have to go.

00:13:27.820 --> 00:13:28.740
That's right!

00:13:34.450 --> 00:13:37.420
Round One - The Swimming Contest!

00:13:37.420 --> 00:13:38.580
YEAH!!

00:13:39.250 --> 00:13:42.710
Well then, I'll introduce our contestants!

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:52.180
First up are the young hope of our swimming team, Yayoi Mina-san, and the secret weapon of the volleyball team, Kasuga Tsukasa!

00:13:52.810 --> 00:13:55.730
Mina-chan!

00:13:56.690 --> 00:13:58.020
Let's go, Mina-chan.

00:13:58.310 --> 00:13:59.310
R-Right!

00:13:59.900 --> 00:14:09.030
As you all know, they will be competing against Higashino Yukari-chan, a super drama idol!

00:14:10.780 --> 00:14:12.660
YUKARI!!

00:14:12.660 --> 00:14:13.950
Thanks!

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:20.040
I don't know how well I can swim, but you'll do fine!

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:21.290
We can't lose!

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:22.920
Y-Yes.

00:14:24.880 --> 00:14:30.090
They call her a "super idol," but this isn't a fair fight.

00:14:31.220 --> 00:14:37.850
Okay! Yukari-chan, please select a teammate.

00:14:38.350 --> 00:14:43.480
I'll do fine on my own, but if you say so...

00:14:45.530 --> 00:14:46.900
I'll take her!

00:14:51.280 --> 00:14:53.620
Wh-Why did you pick me?

00:14:55.040 --> 00:14:57.500
Amamiya-san in a swimsuit!

00:14:58.620 --> 00:14:59.750
You've got to be kidding me.

00:15:00.210 --> 00:15:01.290
I'm going home.

00:15:02.420 --> 00:15:03.960
Hold it right there, Amamiya-kun!

00:15:04.420 --> 00:15:07.420
This is your job as part of the Administrative Committee!

00:15:07.420 --> 00:15:08.590
No, it's your DUTY!

00:15:10.550 --> 00:15:12.010
That's not a good reason.

00:15:12.970 --> 00:15:17.680
Say, you like Riku, don't you?

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:21.100
What are you saying?

00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:23.230
Then it shouldn't matter!

00:15:23.230 --> 00:15:26.940
Help me win Riku's love!

00:15:29.650 --> 00:15:30.450
A-All right.

00:15:30.900 --> 00:15:32.990
This is for the school, after all.

00:15:35.490 --> 00:15:37.700
Amamiya-san's on her team...

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:40.500
We're not gonna lose to them!

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:46.800
Even Amamiya-san's in on it now...

00:15:47.800 --> 00:15:48.800
Are you ready?

00:15:49.630 --> 00:15:50.380
On your marks.

00:15:50.380 --> 00:15:52.880
Sign Says: I Love Mina!

00:15:53.300 --> 00:15:54.180
Get set.

00:16:08.070 --> 00:16:12.950
Even if I'm up against Amamiya-san, I'm not going to lose this time!

00:16:18.950 --> 00:16:19.790
Mina-chan!

00:16:19.790 --> 00:16:20.750
Keep it up!

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:24.540
That's just what I'd expect from a member of an inter-varsity swim team.

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:25.290
Not bad.

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:28.710
I'm not gonna lose! No matter what!

00:16:30.550 --> 00:16:32.340
I wonder...

00:16:36.260 --> 00:16:37.180
All right.

00:16:37.180 --> 00:16:38.350
Here I go!

00:16:40.390 --> 00:16:42.680
Activating Talent Aura!

00:16:49.860 --> 00:16:50.480
Kasuga-san?

00:16:51.780 --> 00:16:52.530
Are you all right?

00:16:52.740 --> 00:16:53.280
Kasuga-san!

00:16:54.200 --> 00:16:55.030
Papa!

00:16:55.450 --> 00:16:58.870
Now I'm one step closer to making Riku mine!

00:16:57.620 --> 00:16:59.580
Kasuga-san! Hang in there!

00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:00.410
Kasuga-san!

00:17:00.910 --> 00:17:01.830
Kasuga-san!

00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:04.120
Are you all right, Kasuga-san?

00:17:04.830 --> 00:17:06.670
Kasuga-san! Hang in there!

00:17:06.880 --> 00:17:07.750
Kasuga-san!

00:17:25.310 --> 00:17:26.100
All right!

00:17:26.390 --> 00:17:28.060
We did it, Kasuga-san!

00:17:28.520 --> 00:17:32.570
Even if I can't spike my shots, I can still serve well.

00:17:33.990 --> 00:17:38.820
Now, an incident occurred during the swimming event, and Kasuga's team lost.

00:17:39.570 --> 00:17:43.500
But all the girls are playing well in this volleyball contest.

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:45.910
The score is 24-23!

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:48.580
Kasuga and Yayoi have a match point!

00:17:48.830 --> 00:17:51.000
Mina-chan, let's end it with the next point.

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:51.630
Yes!

00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:56.800
Excuse me.

00:17:56.800 --> 00:17:58.220
Time out, please!

00:17:58.470 --> 00:17:59.640
Time out!

00:18:04.060 --> 00:18:07.100
I'm sorry I got you mixed up in this, Amamiya-san.

00:18:07.980 --> 00:18:10.190
That's all right. This is also my job.

00:18:11.310 --> 00:18:13.150
But we're nearly there.

00:18:13.730 --> 00:18:16.900
If we can win this, Riku will be mine!

00:18:19.280 --> 00:18:22.910
And besides, those two are really strong opponents.

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:24.450
They must really like Riku.

00:18:24.660 --> 00:18:26.080
Yes.

00:18:29.580 --> 00:18:31.710
But I'm not gonna lose.

00:18:32.960 --> 00:18:36.130
Because I love Riku.

00:18:38.090 --> 00:18:40.090
We made a promise.

00:18:41.140 --> 00:18:46.560
When we were kids, we promised that we'd always be together.

00:18:51.560 --> 00:18:52.980
Time's up!

00:18:53.480 --> 00:18:54.730
All players, get into position!

00:18:57.990 --> 00:19:00.360
Are you all right with that?

00:19:04.240 --> 00:19:08.330
Asking you that won't mean anything.

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:12.920
Because you're fighting for me, aren't you?

00:19:25.600 --> 00:19:27.890
What's Amamiya-san doing?

00:19:29.180 --> 00:19:30.850
What's wrong, Amamiya-kun?

00:19:30.850 --> 00:19:32.480
You should get back on the court.

00:19:33.860 --> 00:19:37.400
I-I... I...

00:19:39.110 --> 00:19:40.820
I... really...

00:19:40.820 --> 00:19:41.860
That's far enough!

00:19:52.920 --> 00:19:55.710
K-Kurotokage-sensei?

00:19:56.670 --> 00:19:57.920
Sensei!

00:19:58.670 --> 00:20:01.550
It's been such a long time, Higashino-san.

00:20:01.550 --> 00:20:03.970
Yes! You look well!

00:20:05.100 --> 00:20:06.510
E-Excuse me...

00:20:07.010 --> 00:20:08.470
What about the volleyball match?

00:20:09.350 --> 00:20:10.390
So that means...

00:20:10.390 --> 00:20:11.850
What are they doing?

00:20:12.560 --> 00:20:14.560
Oh, well...

00:20:18.860 --> 00:20:20.110
WHAT?!

00:20:20.360 --> 00:20:22.610
Kurotokage-sensei set the whole thing up?

00:20:23.610 --> 00:20:24.530
Yes.

00:20:24.570 --> 00:20:34.540
I wanted Amamiya-san to see some real acting before the Culture Festival, so I had Higashino-san do that for me.

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:39.340
Well, I've also been in some school plays.

00:20:39.880 --> 00:20:43.130
Instead of doing a rehearsal, I decided to experience school life for real.

00:20:43.840 --> 00:20:45.430
B-But that's...

00:20:46.390 --> 00:20:51.140
But I never expected Yukari-chan to be Kurotokage-sensei's apprentice.

00:20:51.810 --> 00:20:54.890
Well, that's because I'm such a wonderful teacher.

00:20:54.890 --> 00:20:57.440
She's such a good actress.

00:20:57.440 --> 00:20:59.020
Thank you very much.

00:20:59.440 --> 00:21:03.190
But you're as good as I'd hoped for, Amamiya-san.

00:21:03.190 --> 00:21:04.900
If you practice, you'll shine even brighter!

00:21:04.900 --> 00:21:05.950
Oh, my!

00:21:06.780 --> 00:21:08.660
Hold it!

00:21:08.660 --> 00:21:10.660
What about Aoba?

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:16.120
Well, all of my fans are my lovers!

00:21:18.290 --> 00:21:20.670
I-I see...

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:26.720
Thanks, everyone!

00:21:27.300 --> 00:21:28.010
See ya!

00:21:34.890 --> 00:21:36.440
Hey, Amamiya-san.

00:21:37.770 --> 00:21:38.150
Yes?

00:21:39.190 --> 00:21:44.280
Listen, when I quit being an idol, I might make Riku my boyfriend.

00:21:45.820 --> 00:21:47.660
So do your best, okay?

00:21:48.240 --> 00:21:50.070
H-Higashino-san!

00:21:50.740 --> 00:21:51.240
See ya!

00:21:51.490 --> 00:21:52.120
Till next time!

00:22:00.460 --> 00:22:02.590
Geez. What was all that about?

00:22:02.920 --> 00:22:05.340
I'm tired for some reason.

00:22:05.970 --> 00:22:08.930
I really am no match for her.

00:22:32.030 --> 00:22:36.620
As the morning sunlight streams through

00:22:37.120 --> 00:22:41.790
I immediately start to think of you.

00:22:43.500 --> 00:22:48.220
The moment our eyes first met

00:22:48.760 --> 00:22:53.970
This love began.

00:22:55.310 --> 00:22:59.940
This light illuminates our future

00:23:00.400 --> 00:23:06.360
Because you're my destined one.

00:23:06.940 --> 00:23:11.870
I start to smile.

00:23:12.410 --> 00:23:16.910
This very feeling, I've been searching for it all along.

00:23:18.580 --> 00:23:24.040
I have grasped this piece of a miracle which fell into this world.

00:23:24.380 --> 00:23:29.800
I will run to your side, my love!

00:23:30.220 --> 00:23:35.390
The two of us can overcome any obstacle, no matter how high.

00:23:35.680 --> 00:23:42.150
Even though our love is still young, it's my treasure!

00:23:49.990 --> 00:23:52.410
Next Episode Preview

00:23:51.490 --> 00:23:54.150
This sucks. There are so many weird people at school.

00:23:54.180 --> 00:23:55.580
You think so? But everyone's so nice.

00:23:55.620 --> 00:23:58.930
Well, I was scared of Kurotokage-sensei until I got used to her.

00:23:59.030 --> 00:24:00.510
I don't think so.

00:24:00.540 --> 00:24:02.950
And Doujima uses all these weird techniques.

00:24:03.120 --> 00:24:05.000
People can do anything if they train hard enough.

00:24:05.020 --> 00:24:05.930
What about Riku?

00:24:06.050 --> 00:24:07.680
He gets along well with Hiyoko.

00:24:07.740 --> 00:24:09.780
He might be a zookeeper in the future.

00:24:10.350 --> 00:24:12.690
Next on Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love:

00:24:13.020 --> 00:24:13.950
An Exciting Reality.

00:24:14.170 --> 00:24:14.960
Please watch it.

00:24:15.440 --> 00:24:18.770
Amamiya-san, I think you should be more realistic.
